   "title": "Solution",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&f(-2)=3\\Rightarrow -2a+b=3\\ldots \\text{ (i)}\\\\[5pt]&f(4)=10\\Rightarrow 4a+b=10\\ldots \\text{ (ii)}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Subtract (i) from (ii): }6a=7\\\\[5pt]&\\therefore a=\\frac{7}{6}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{From (i): }b=3+2a=3+\\frac{7}{3}\\\\[5pt]&\\therefore b=\\frac{16}{3}\\\\[5pt]&\\therefore \\text{ }\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{a=\\frac{7}{6},b=\\frac{16}{3}}}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{(Check: }4(\\frac{7}{6})+\\frac{16}{3}=\\frac{14}{3}+\\frac{16}{3}=10\\text{ $\\;\\checkmark$)}\\end{aligned}\\]",
